${row('feature-private','Private session','Don’t save new history, tabs or AI chats.','Private sessions do not record new history, save tab URLs or save AI chats. Turning this on removes saved tab URLs; explicitly saved bookmarks and previous history remain. This controls Poxey’s local saving; it does not isolate website cookies or erase the outer browser’s own history.')}
${row('feature-history','Save browsing history','Keep recent visits on this device.','When enabled outside Private mode, Poxey stores page titles and URLs locally, up to 500 entries. Existing history remains when you turn recording off. Search or remove it in History.')}
