${row('feature-cloud-ai','Allow cloud AI','Send messages to cloud AI when available.','When enabled, messages you send and a bounded portion of your chat go through the local development backend to the configured provider (Google Gemini or Groq) for cloud processing. Provider keys stay on the server. Anonymous AI session and usage records are stored separately from optional visitor analytics; no prompt text is stored in operational metrics. New chats and approved document text stay in memory for this page visit only, including Private mode; reload or leaving clears them. Older saved chat records require explicit removal in Conversations. Provider retention is separate. Answers can be wrong; free shared limits apply. Google’s free tier may use submitted content to improve its products. Page sharing, automatic editable-document reading and public research require their separate optional settings below. Neither enables screenshots. Selected public queries may go to Exa; do not include secrets. See <a href="https://groq.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Groq privacy</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google privacy</a>.')}
